{"h":0.015634374034648069,"y":0.50962467371256182,"text":"2 Complete the text with the correct form of the verbs","w":0.44693096160888673,"x":0.022090086553394953},{"text":"in brackets.","y":0.52761627931411947,"x":0.046666668920749214,"w":0.095555553436279306,"h":0.010342904304971534},{"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"A lazy wolf lived in a jungle. There was a small lake near his","x":0.035555547344780898,"w":0.39777778625488286,"y":0.55087209341302046},{"x":0.03333333536111107,"w":0.17999999999999997,"text":"house where other animals'","y":0.56244897969090368,"h":0.011836734693877582},{"h":0.0087209296713069984,"w":0.17999999999999999,"text":"(come) to drink fresh water.","y":0.56395348861638139,"x":0.28444444669444435},{"x":0.18222222723038733,"text":"(always\/sit) nearby, hoping 3","y":0.57412790659577717,"h":0.013219032287597576,"w":0.19111110687255861},{"text":"(get) fresh food easily. This really annoyed the animals but there","w":0.42222221374511726,"h":0.011836734693877471,"x":0.033333342849663515,"y":0.58857142848064925},{"w":0.43111110687255855,"y":0.60163265325183546,"h":0.011836734693877582,"text":"was no other pond. One day, the wolf found a dead bull. 'What good","x":0.035555554563720795},{"x":0.033333335600757741,"h":0.013158519511320077,"text":"luck!' he thought. While he 4.","w":0.19111110687255858,"y":0.61337209307833518},{"y":0.61183673468112787,"x":0.29111111709040427,"w":0.12222221374511721,"text":"(eat) the bull, he 5","h":0.011836734693877582},{"x":0.033333333072558521,"h":0.011627906487912565,"y":0.6264534885292995,"text":"(realise) that another animal might pass by. The wolf fancied","w":0.39777778625488286},{"text":"(eat) the bull all by himself and because he refused","h":0.011627906487912565,"y":0.63953488411069492,"w":0.33555553436279295,"x":0.12000000951304798},{"y":0.6497093026807943,"w":0.18444444656372072,"x":0.12000000171813958,"h":0.01453488252600843,"text":"(share) his meal, he began ®"},{"h":0.010220692692970657,"w":0.15111110687255858,"y":0.66569767473563124,"text":"the meat more quickly.","x":0.033333333563720743},{"text":"Because he?","x":0.035536415086196559,"y":0.68162665372171594,"w":0.084482727050781248,"h":0.011746692268215897},{"x":0.19555556106372066,"y":0.68313953512800929,"h":0.0087209296713069984,"text":"(eat) so fast he didn't notice a small bone.","w":0.27111110687255857},{"w":0.42237262725830083,"h":0.013708148878447846,"x":0.035463850723161945,"y":0.69432969709802284,"text":"This got stuck deep in his throat and was really painful. 'Ooooh,"},{"w":0.42666664123535158,"y":0.70775510192364444,"x":0.035555567660101983,"text":"this hurts! What now?' thought the wolf. Luckily, he remembered","h":0.011836734693877582},{"h":0.013176317020338391,"y":0.71947674389592242,"x":0.035555562821885794,"w":0.24222221374511718,"text":"that a crane lived nearby and so he 1°"},{"h":0.01370728006168298,"x":0.3376993991632285,"w":0.12015675544738769,"text":"_ (find) the crane","y":0.72061729004284369},{"w":0.27620203018188477,"h":0.016436145548917813,"text":"and begged him to remove the bone. I 11","y":0.73010430984370045,"x":0.035205036114067167},{"y":0.73387755108007791,"text":"(give) you","w":0.07111110687255856,"x":0.38222222426742442,"h":0.011836734693877582},{"h":0.016052009426817615,"text":"a present if you help me, he promised.","w":0.25172279357910154,"x":0.035277938259352194,"y":0.74422140205903897},{"x":0.035555558954797631,"h":0.013081395674724883,"text":"The crane was a friendly creature and told the wolf 12","y":0.76162790659577717,"w":0.34888889312744142},{"w":0.41111110687255853,"y":0.77616279089364071,"x":0.035555564526683445,"text":"(open) his jaws wide. The crane reached into the wolf's mouth","h":0.011627906487912565},{"x":0.035555557301472904,"y":0.7877551023662579,"w":0.2244444465637207,"h":0.01311699069276151,"text":"and with its long beak managed 13"},{"w":0.13333333015441895,"x":0.33555555881167942,"text":"(pull) the bone free.","y":0.78924418625452653,"h":0.010347650489028637},{"h":0.010327479693354458,"w":0.43111110687255866,"text":"The wolf was relieved but when the crane asked for his present he","y":0.80232558158519507,"x":0.037777787082239021},{"y":0.81381785405200724,"x":0.035382704150758393,"h":0.012034552437918511,"w":0.21371143341064452,"text":"responded: 'I don't remember 14"},{"h":0.013214285714285734,"y":0.81249999995818023,"text":"(promise) anything'","w":0.13777777671813968,"x":0.32444444267796724},{"y":0.83139534908162516,"w":0.28444442749023435,"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"'You said that if I removed the bone, you 15","x":0.03555555929192003},{"y":0.83265306119975502,"h":0.010370194182104053,"text":"(give) me","x":0.39333333448964664,"w":0.071111106872558616},{"text":"a present,' said the crane with obvious disappointment.","h":0.011627906487912454,"w":0.35777778625488282,"y":0.84447674428511355,"x":0.035555548400336472},{"y":0.86191860498278794,"w":0.1111111068725586,"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"The wolf, who 16","x":0.037777778785942927},{"x":0.22444444615521925,"h":0.011836734693877471,"w":0.20222221374511717,"y":0.86326530630362519,"text":"(already\/begin) walking away,"},{"text":"stopped1","y":0.87209302361102681,"w":0.068888888359069811,"h":0.01453488252600843,"x":0.037777778746390996},{"h":0.010301375875667595,"text":"(say): 'You put your head into my mouth","x":0.18000000909116204,"w":0.27333332061767579,"y":0.87632653076588141},{"x":0.037777786298190605,"w":0.25777776718139644,"text":"and are still alive. Is that not a present?'","y":0.88808139548424148,"h":0.011627906487912565},{"x":0.03777778069819071,"h":0.010174418079609726,"y":0.90552325614914853,"w":0.23777776718139648,"text":"The crane at that moment decided 18"},{"w":0.093395586013793941,"y":0.90541608920556149,"x":0.35330220606008766,"text":"(not help) any","h":0.011842240314094421},{"w":0.18666666030883786,"x":0.037777781104840306,"h":0.010374940755415896,"text":"other creatures in the future.","y":0.91860465125573776},{"h":0.010174418079